# Prompt-to-API Generation Patterns

## Core Functionality
- Use proper state machines for the generation flow
- Implement proper loading states with rotating messages
- Handle database schema validation
- Generate proper Cloudflare Worker code
- Implement proper error handling for generation failures

## AI Integration
- Use AI SDK for Anthropic integration
- Implement proper prompt engineering
- Handle AI response validation
- Implement proper error handling for AI failures
- Use proper streaming for long responses

## Database Schema Validation
- Validate database connection strings
- Check schema compatibility with generated queries
- Handle database errors gracefully
- Implement proper query validation
- Use proper transaction patterns

## Generated API Structure
- Include proper TypeScript types
- Implement proper error handling
- Add authentication and rate limiting
- Include proper logging
- Follow RESTful API patterns